Package: xtop
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3
Description: Terminal UI for xcapture thread activity analysis
 XTOP is an advanced terminal-based visualization and analysis tool for Linux
 system performance data collected by xcapture. It provides interactive
 exploration of system metrics through a powerful TUI (Terminal User Interface)
 built with Python and the Textual framework.
 .
 Key features:
  * Interactive TUI with dynamic query system
  * Latency histograms and time-series heatmaps
  * Stack trace viewing with symbol resolution
  * System call and I/O request latency analysis
